---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects - wReady Showcase" description="Screenplay projects managed in wReady">
  <section class="projects-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Projects</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        Screenplay series with full production bible support: episodes, scenes, characters, 
        locations, plot threads, and thematic analysis.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="projects-list">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Featured Project</h2>
      
      <article class="project-card featured">
        <div class="project-header">
          <div>
            <h3><em>Her Majesty's Displeasure</em></h3>
            <p class="project-type">Television · Limited Series · 6 Episodes</p>
          </div>
          <span class="status-badge">Development</span>
        </div>
        
        <p class="logline">
          When The Beatles are awarded MBEs in 1965, Prince Philip responds not with pride but by 
          quietly unleashing MI5 to rein them in. Caught between royal paranoia and John Lennon's 
          growing rebellion, two hapless intelligence officers oversee a campaign that exposes how 
          petty grudges, bad paperwork, and institutional absurdity can reshape history.
        </p>

        <div class="project-features">
          <h4>What's Included</h4>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Full Series Bible:</strong> Tone, visual language, structural comparisons</li>
            <li><strong>Episode Breakdown:</strong> 6 episodes with loglines and act structures</li>
            <li><strong>Character Database:</strong> Main and supporting characters with arcs</li>
            <li><strong>Location Library:</strong> Abbey Road Studios, Apple Corps HQ, MI5 offices</li>
            <li><strong>Thematic Analysis:</strong> Power vs. Art, Absurdity of Bureaucracy, Myth vs. Reality</li>
            <li><strong>Plot Threads:</strong> Main and sub-plots tracked across episodes</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="project-tech">
          <h4>Technical Features</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Custom screenplay formatting via MDX plugin</li>
            <li>Relational data between characters, locations, and scenes</li>
            <li>Tension graphing across episodes</li>
            <li>TMDB integration for cast reference images</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <a href="/wready/projects/her-majestys-displeasure" class="view-project-btn">
          View Full Project →
        </a>
      </article>

      <div class="coming-soon">
        <p>Additional projects coming soon as they're developed...</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Project Management Features</h2>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>📝 Screenplay Formatting</h3>
          <p>Industry-standard formatting with custom MDX components for scene headings, action, dialogue, and transitions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>🎭 Character Tracking</h3>
          <p>Detailed character profiles with arcs, relationships, and appearance tracking across scenes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>📍 Location Database</h3>
          <p>Organized location library with INT/EXT designation, real-world references, and scene associations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>📊 Plot Threading</h3>
          <p>Track main and sub-plots across episodes with beat-by-beat breakdowns and tension analysis.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>🎨 Thematic Analysis</h3>
          <p>Connect themes across scenes and episodes to maintain narrative coherence.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h3>📈 Tension Graphing</h3>
          <p>Visualize dramatic tension across episodes to ensure proper pacing and structure.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .projects-hero {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .projects-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 700px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .projects-list {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
  }

  .project-card {
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .project-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    border-width: 2px;
  }

  .project-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .project-type {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .status-badge {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: var(--status-draft);
    border-radius: 2rem;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .logline {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .project-features,
  .project-tech {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .project-features h4,
  .project-tech h4 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .project-features ul,
  .project-tech ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    list-style: disc;
  }

  .project-features li,
  .project-tech li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .project-features strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .view-project-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .view-project-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent-dark);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .coming-soon {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .features-section {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .projects-hero h1 {
      font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    }

    .project-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>